      "paragraph_count": 1,
      "first_block_index": 3,
      "last_block_index": 4,
      "preview": "Revisions to standing offers Standing offers are not contracts and so cannot be amended or assigned. Amendments to the terms or the duration are managed through a process of revisions. The key points regarding revisions are detailed below.",
      "prev_section_id": "22775f4199ee::s002",
      "next_section_id": "22775f4199ee::s004"
    },
    {
