      "list_count": 0,
      "paragraph_count": 1,
      "first_block_index": 5,
      "last_block_index": 6,
      "preview": "Withdrawal notification Standing offers typically have a provision that an offeror must provide 30 days written notice of its intent to withdraw its request for standing offer (RFSO). You would then issue a \"Revision to the Standing Offer a",
