      "paragraph_count": 1,
      "first_block_index": 9,
      "last_block_index": 10,
      "preview": "Offeror revisions Offerors may revise their SO within the parameters set by the RFSO solicitation process. You would then issue a \"Revision to the standing offer and call-up authority\" to reflect the appropriate revisions.",
