      "markdown": "## Revisions to standing offers",
      "plain_text": "Revisions to standing offers"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "22775f4199ee::b0005",
      "section_id": "22775f4199ee::s003",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "heading_path": [
        "Buyer's Guide Modify a contract - Revisions to standing offers",
        "Buyer's Guide",
        "Revisions to standing offers"
      ],
      "markdown": "Standing offers are not contracts and so cannot be amended or assigned. Amendments to the terms or the duration are managed through a process of revisions. The key points regarding revisions are detailed below.",
      "plain_text": "Standing offers are not contracts and so cannot be amended or assigned. Amendments to the terms or the duration are managed through a process of revisions. The key points regarding revisions are detailed below."
    },
    {
      "block_id": "22775f4199ee::b0006",
      "section_id": "22775f4199ee::s004",
      "type": "heading",
      "heading_path": [
        "Buyer's Guide Modify a contract - Revisions to standing offers",
        "Buyer's Guide",
        "Revisions to standing offers",
        "Withdrawal notification"
      ],
      "markdown": "### Withdrawal notification",
      "plain_text": "Withdrawal notification"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "22775f4199ee::b0007",
      "section_id": "22775f4199ee::s004",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "heading_path": [
        "Buyer's Guide Modify a contract - Revisions to standing offers",
        "Buyer's Guide",
        "Revisions to standing offers",
        "Withdrawal notification"
      ],
      "markdown": "Standing offers typically have a provision that an offeror must provide 30 days written notice of its intent to withdraw its request for standing offer (RFSO). You would then issue a \"Revision to the Standing Offer and Call-up Authority\", to notify all the identified users and the offeror of the effective date of the withdrawal. Call-ups received by the offeror before the effective withdrawal date are legally binding and must be honored.",
      "plain_text": "Standing offers typically have a provision that an offeror must provide 30 days written notice of its intent to withdraw its request for standing offer (RFSO). You would then issue a \"Revision to the Standing Offer and Call-up Authority\", to notify all the identified users and the offeror of the effective date of the withdrawal. Call-ups received by the offeror before the effective withdrawal date are legally binding and must be honored."
    },
    {
      "block_id": "22775f4199ee::b0008",
      "section_id": "22775f4199ee::s005",
      "type": "heading",
      "heading_path": [
        "Buyer's Guide Modify a contract - Revisions to standing offers",
        "Buyer's Guide",
        "Revisions to standing offers",
        "Revision issuance"
      ],
      "markdown": "### Revision issuance",
      "plain_text": "Revision issuance"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "22775f4199ee::b0009",
      "section_id": "22775f4199ee::s005",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "heading_path": [
        "Buyer's Guide Modify a contract - Revisions to standing offers",
        "Buyer's Guide",
        "Revisions to standing offers",
        "Revision issuance"
      ],
      "markdown": "You can issue revisions to extend the period of the standing offer (SO) or to update any pertinent details within the standing offer.",
      "plain_text": "You can issue revisions to extend the period of the standing offer (SO) or to update any pertinent details within the standing offer."
    },
    {
      "block_id": "22775f4199ee::b0010",
      "section_id": "22775f4199ee::s006",
      "type": "heading",
      "heading_path": [
        "Buyer's Guide Modify a contract - Revisions to standing offers",
        "Buyer's Guide",
        "Revisions to standing offers",
        "Offeror revisions"
      ],
      "markdown": "### Offeror revisions",
      "plain_text": "Offeror revisions"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "22775f4199ee::b0011",
      "section_id": "22775f4199ee::s006",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "heading_path": [
        "Buyer's Guide Modify a contract - Revisions to standing offers",
        "Buyer's Guide",
        "Revisions to standing offers",
        "Offeror revisions"
      ],
      "markdown": "Offerors may revise their SO within the parameters set by the RFSO solicitation process. You would then issue a \"Revision to the standing offer and call-up authority\" to reflect the appropriate revisions.",
      "plain_text": "Offerors may revise their SO within the parameters set by the RFSO solicitation process. You would then issue a \"Revision to the standing offer and call-up authority\" to reflect the appropriate revisions."
